 <h3><u>Sar dare Aale Mohammad</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=Apple-style-span arial, sans-serif; line-height: normal; border-collapse: collapse; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); ></span></p>
  <div>
   Maula (A.s.) Ya Maula (A.s.).....2
   <br>Assalam Aai Mustafa (S.a.w.w.)
   <br>Assalam Aai Murtaza (S.a.)
   <br>As Salam Aai Saiyada (S.a.)
   <br>As Salam Aai Mujtaba (A.s.)
   <br>Ya Shaheed E Karbala (A.s.)
   <br>
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye
   <br>Apni Naslon Ko Wafadari Sikha Na Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye
   <br>
   <br>Aai Khud Jannat Kisi Mohtaj Ko Karde Ata.....2
   <br>Mujhko Jannat Ki Jagah Aashur Khana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye.....2
   <br>
   <br>Koi Namus E Risalat Par Agar Hamla Kare.....2
   <br>Aaise Murda Shaks Ko Zinda Jalana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye.....2
   <br>
   <br>Aadmi Ko Saheb e Eman Hone Ke Liye.....2
   <br>Dhoom Se Jashn e Abutalib (a.s.) Manana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye.....2
   <br>
   <br>Baap Ki Jagir Par Bete Ka Haq Hai Isliye.....2
   <br>Ek Alam Kabe Ki Chat Par Bhi Lagana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye.....2
   <br>
   <br>Jinke Dil Me Jal Raha Hai Bugz E Haider (A.s.) Ka Dia.....2
   <br>Unko Kabron Me Nahi Samshan Jaana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye.....2
   <br>
   <br>Jo Arize Jism Par Likhta Hun Mai Zanjeer Se.....2
   <br>Fan Yehi Maula Meri Naslonme Aana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye
   <br>
   <br>Yeh Sabab Akbar Diya Hai Hum Ko Meesam Ne Sada.....2
   <br>Kutch Bhi Ho Jaai Aqeede Ko Bachana Chahiye
   <br>Sar Dare Aale Mohammed (A.s.) Par Jhukana Chahiye
   <br>
   <br>Maula (A.s.) Ya Maula (A.s.).....
   <br>Ya Shahe Karbobala (A.s.)
